<Box style={{width: 1280, height: 720, background: "#FAFAF7", padding: "28px 64px 24px", flexDirection: "column", fontFamily: "PingFang SC"}}><Box style={{height: 96, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.40)", letterSpacing: 1}}>第四幕 · 两个进展</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.25, marginTop: 10}}>没有特权核心 —— 所有能力都是插件</Text></Box><Box style={{height: 532, flexDirection: "column", gap: 20}}><Box style={{height: 310, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center"}}><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", gap: 16}}><Box style={{height: 60, flex: 1, background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.035)", borderRadius: 20, justifyContent: "center", alignItems: "center", border: "1px solid rgba(28,31,35,0.18)"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.62)"}}>引导</Text></Box><Box style={{height: 60, flex: 1, background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.035)", borderRadius: 20, justifyContent: "center", alignItems: "center", border: "1px solid rgba(28,31,35,0.18)"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.62)"}}>工具</Text></Box><Box style={{height: 60, flex: 1, background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.035)", borderRadius: 20, justifyContent: "center", alignItems: "center", border: "1px solid rgba(28,31,35,0.18)"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.62)"}}>会话</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{height: 76, flexDirection: "row", justifyContent: "center", alignItems: "center", borderRadius: 8, border: "1px dashed rgba(28,31,35,0.30)", marginTop: 14, marginBottom: 14}}><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)"}}>（这里没有核心）</Text></Box><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", gap: 16}}><Box style={{height: 60, flex: 1, background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.035)", borderRadius: 20, justifyContent: "center", alignItems: "center", border: "1px solid rgba(28,31,35,0.18)"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.62)"}}>模式</Text></Box><Box style={{height: 60, flex: 1, background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.035)", borderRadius: 20, justifyContent: "center", alignItems: "center", border: "1px solid rgba(28,31,35,0.18)"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.62)"}}>长程</Text></Box><Box style={{height: 60, flex: 1, background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.035)", borderRadius: 20, justifyContent: "center", alignItems: "center", border: "1px solid rgba(28,31,35,0.18)"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.62)"}}>模型接入</Text></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{height: 202, flexDirection: "row", gap: 20, alignItems: "stretch"}}><Box style={{flex: 1, flexDirection: "column", padding: 22, background: "rgba(15,110,86,0.07)", borderRadius: 8}}><Text style={{fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 600, color: "#0F6E56"}}>没有特权核心</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.55, marginTop: 10}}>不存在必须改源码才能动的东西——所有能力都是插件</Text></Box><Box style={{flex: 1, flexDirection: "column", padding: 22, background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.035)", borderRadius: 8}}><Text style={{fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23"}}>四种运行模式</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.55, marginTop: 10}}>本质是四套默认插件集</Text></Box><Box style={{flex: 1, flexDirection: "column", padding: 22, background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.035)", borderRadius: 8}}><Text style={{fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23"}}>长程也不是单一 loop</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.55, marginTop: 10}}>几种接力方式并存</Text></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{height: 40, flexDirection: "row", justifyContent: "space-between", alignItems: "flex-end"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.35)"}}>AI CODING EVOLUTION</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)"}}>32 / 45</Text></Box></Box>
